<title>USA: Access Beyond stake taken by Chilton group.</title>
<headline>Access Beyond stake taken by Chilton group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investment adviser Richard Chilton said Monday he has acquired 850,000 shares of Access Beyond Inc, or 7.1 percent of the total outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Chilton said he acquired the stake for investment purposes for a total of $9,738,170.</p>
<p>The stake includes a net 763,900 shares that were bought between Oct. 8 and Nov. 21.</p>
